OL,3,GNEWSAUganda will now take part in
OL,4,AHarry's Invictus Games after King's
OL,5,Areassurance
OL,6,
OL,7,FUganda's military leaders have
OL,8,Fconfirmed their country will take part
OL,9,Fin Prince Harry's Invictus Games for
OL,10,Fwounded veterans, after saying last
OL,11,Fweek they were going to pull out of the
OL,12,Fevent.
OL,14,FThe change of heart follows a phone
OL,15,Fcall with the King's principal private
OL,16,Fsecretary, Sir Clive Alderton, who told
OL,17,Fthem the King had "no problem" with
OL,18,FUganda's participation in the games.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
