OL,3,GNEWSAUganda will now take part in
OL,4,AHarry's Invictus Games after King's
OL,5,Areassurance
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis support from Buckingham Palace is
OL,8,Flikely to be seen as an olive branch,
OL,9,Fhelping Prince Harry with his sports
OL,10,Fevents for injured service men and
OL,11,Fwomen.
OL,13,FIt had seemed that Uganda's involvement
OL,14,Fwould be a victim of the fall-out over
OL,15,Fa letter sent on behalf of the King
OL,16,Fclarifying that Prince Harry and Meghan
OL,17,Fremained non-working royals.
